...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

front: "사용자 쪽 화면" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 2
  user: 사용자 { class: person }
  ui: Streamlit UI (corrective_rag.py) { class: ours }
}

graph: "CRAG 그래프 (LangGraph)" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 3
  retrieve: "1. 검색" { class: ours }
  grade: "2. 채점" { class: ours }
  transform: "3. 재작성" { class: ours }
  websearch: "4. 웹검색" { class: ours }
  generate: "5. 생성" { class: ours }
}

qdrant: Qdrant 컬렉션 (rag-qdrant) { class: store }

providers: "외부 서비스" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 1
  openai: OpenAI 임베딩 { class: ext }
  claude: Claude Sonnet 4.5 { class: ext }
  tavily: Tavily 검색 { class: ext }
}

front.ui -> graph: 질문 텍스트
graph -> qdrant: 문서 임베딩·유사도 검색
graph -> providers: 채점·재작성·생성(Claude), 임베딩(OpenAI), 웹 검색(Tavily)
